gThai(\&quot;Dang su dung\&quot;)\n    Service -&gt; TS : capNhatDonViSuDung(maPB, maNV, viTriMoi)\n    activate TS\n    TS --&gt; Service : daCapNhat\n    deactivate TS\nend\n\nService --&gt; Form : KetQua.Ok(maPhieuCP)\ndeactivate Service\nForm --&gt; NV : Thong bao lap phieu cap phat thanh cong\ndeactivate Form\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="qRJLRyRJTnpY73xdt3vA-1">
